{
  "$schema": "iswc-preview/v1",
  "tag": "iswc-mutation-observer",
  "category": "helpers",
  "title": "&lt;iswc-mutation-observer&gt;",
  "titleHtml": false,
  "styles": [
    ".mo-grid {",
    "      display: grid;",
    "      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;",
    "      gap: 1rem;",
    "      align-items: stretch;",
    "    }",
    "    @media (max-width: 900px) {",
    "      .mo-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }",
    "    }",
    "    .mo-panel {",
    "      border: 1px solid var(--iswc-border);",
    "      border-radius: var(--iswc-radius);",
    "      background: var(--iswc-bg);",
    "      padding: 0.85rem;",
    "      min-height: 0;",
    "    }",
    "    .mo-panel__title {",
    "      display: flex;",
    "      align-items: center;",
    "      justify-content: space-between;",
    "      gap: 0.5rem;",
    "      font-size: 0.72rem;",
    "      font-weight: 600;",
    "      letter-spacing: 0.05em;",
    "      text-transform: uppercase;",
    "      color: var(--iswc-text-dim);",
    "      margin-bottom: 0.65rem;",
    "    }",
    "    .mo-target {",
    "      padding: 1rem;",
    "      background: var(--iswc-control-bg);",
    "      border-radius: var(--iswc-radius-sm);",
    "      border: 1px solid var(--iswc-border-soft);",
    "      color: var(--iswc-text);",
    "      min-height: 3rem;",
    "      line-height: 1.5;",
    "    }",
    "    .mo-target [data-chip] {",
    "      display: inline-block;",
    "      margin-left: 0.35em;",
    "      padding: 0.1em 0.45em;",
    "      border-radius: 999px;",
    "      background: var(--iswc-brand-soft);",
    "      color: var(--iswc-brand-text);",
    "      font-size: 0.8em;",
    "    }",
    "    .mo-actions {",
    "      display: flex;",
    "      flex-wrap: wrap;",
    "      gap: 0.5rem;",
    "      margin-top: 0.75rem;",
    "    }",
    "    .mo-hint {",
    "      margin-top: 0.75rem;",
    "      font-size: 0.85rem;",
    "      color: var(--iswc-text-soft);",
    "      line-height: 1.45;",
    "    }",
    "    .mo-hint code { font-size: 0.9em; }",
    "    .mo-live {",
    "      margin: 0 !important;",
    "      max-height: 220px;",
    "      overflow: auto;",
    "      font-size: 0.78rem !important;",
    "    }",
    "    .mo-uses {",
    "      display: grid;",
    "      gap: 0.65rem;",
    "      margin: 0 0 1rem;",
    "      padding: 0;",
    "      list-style: none;",
    "    }",
    "    .mo-uses li {",
    "      display: grid;",
    "      grid-template-columns: 1.5rem 1fr;",
    "      gap: 0.55rem;",
    "      align-items: start;",
    "      color: var(--iswc-text-soft);",
    "      font-size: 0.92rem;",
    "      line-height: 1.45;",
    "    }",
    "    .mo-uses iswc-icon {",
    "      width: 1.15em;",
    "      height: 1.15em;",
    "      color: var(--iswc-accent);",
    "      margin-top: 0.15em;",
    "    }",
    "    .log .type-child { color: #69db7c; }",
    "    .log .type-attr { color: #ffe066; }",
    "    .log .type-text { color: #74c0fc; }"
  ],
  "storageKey": "docs-iswc-mutation-observer",
  "hasBehavior": true,
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Uso",
      "lede": [
        "Responde a: <strong>¿cambió el HTML de este nodo?</strong>",
        "          Cuando alguien añade/quita hijos, cambia un atributo o el texto, emite",
        "          <code class=\"code\">iswc-mutate</code> con el detalle de qué pasó."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "callout",
          "html": [
            "<strong>No es Intersection Observer.</strong>",
            "          Aquel mira <em>visibilidad</em> (¿está en pantalla?). Este mira",
            "          <em>estructura</em> (¿se modificó el DOM?). Útil para reaccionar a",
            "          cambios de terceros, sincronizar UI, o depurar qué muta un widget."
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<ul class=\"mo-uses\">",
            "          <li>",
            "            <iswc-icon icon=\"mdi:file-tree-outline\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></iswc-icon>",
            "            <span><strong>child-list</strong> — entra o sale un nodo hijo (<code class=\"code\">appendChild</code>, <code class=\"code\">remove</code>…).</span>",
            "          </li>",
            "          <li>",
            "            <iswc-icon icon=\"mdi:tag-outline\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></iswc-icon>",
            "            <span><strong>attr</strong> — cambia un atributo filtrado (aquí solo <code class=\"code\">data-x</code>).</span>",
            "          </li>",
            "          <li>",
            "            <iswc-icon icon=\"mdi:format-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></iswc-icon>",
            "            <span><strong>character-data</strong> — cambia el texto de un nodo (opcional; no activo en este demo).</span>",
            "          </li>",
            "        </ul>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "demo",
      "title": "Pruébalo: HTML vivo",
      "lede": [
        "A la izquierda el nodo observado; a la derecha su <strong>HTML actual</strong> (<code class=\"code\">outerHTML</code>).",
        "          Cada botón provoca una mutación concreta — mírala reflejada en el código y en el log."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<span class=\"demo-label\">child-list + attr=&quot;data-x&quot;</span>",
            "          <div class=\"mo-grid\">",
            "            <div class=\"mo-panel\">",
            "              <div class=\"mo-panel__title\">Nodo observado</div>",
            "              <iswc-mutation-observer id=\"mo\" child-list attr=\"data-x\">",
            "                <div id=\"moTarget\" class=\"mo-target\" data-x=\"init\">Contenido editable</div>",
            "              </iswc-mutation-observer>",
            "              <div class=\"mo-actions demo-row\">",
            "                <iswc-button id=\"moAdd\" color=\"brand\" variant=\"outlined\" type=\"button\">",
            "                  <iswc-icon slot=\"start\" icon=\"mdi:plus\"></iswc-icon>",
            "                  Añadir hijo",
            "                </iswc-button>",
            "                <iswc-button id=\"moAttr\" color=\"neutral\" variant=\"outlined\" type=\"button\">",
            "                  <iswc-icon slot=\"start\" icon=\"mdi:tag-plus-outline\"></iswc-icon>",
            "                  Cambiar data-x",
            "                </iswc-button>",
            "                <iswc-button id=\"moReset\" color=\"neutral\" variant=\"plain\" type=\"button\">",
            "                  Reset",
            "                </iswc-button>",
            "              </div>",
            "              <p class=\"mo-hint\" id=\"moExplain\">",
            "                Pulsa un botón: verás <em>qué línea de HTML</em> cambia a la derecha.",
            "              </p>",
            "            </div>",
            "",
            "            <div class=\"mo-panel\">",
            "              <div class=\"mo-panel__title\">",
            "                <span>HTML de #moTarget</span>",
            "                <span id=\"moStamp\" style=\"font-weight:500;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0\">en vivo</span>",
            "              </div>",
            "              <pre class=\"code mo-live\" id=\"moHtml\" data-lang=\"html\">&lt;div id=\"moTarget\" class=\"mo-target\" data-x=\"init\"&gt;Contenido editable&lt;/div&gt;</pre>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </div>",
            "",
            "          <div class=\"log\" id=\"moLog\" aria-live=\"polite\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">",
            "            <div class=\"row hint\">Las mutaciones aparecen aquí con tipo y detalle.</div>",
            "          </div>"
          ],
          "controls": [
            {
              "control": "boolean",
              "prop": "attr:child-list",
              "label": "child-list"
            },
            {
              "control": "text",
              "prop": "attr:attr",
              "label": "attr"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reference",
      "title": "Referencia",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Atributo / evento",
            "Qué hace"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code>child-list</code>",
              "Observa altas/bajas de hijos (y, con subtree, nietos)."
            ],
            [
              "<code>attr</code>",
              "Lista de atributos a vigilar (espacio-separados). Activa el filtro."
            ],
            [
              "<code>character-data</code>",
              "Observa cambios de texto."
            ],
            [
              "<code>disabled</code>",
              "Apaga el observer."
            ],
            [
              "<code>iswc-mutate</code>",
              "Evento. <code>detail.records</code> = array de <code>MutationRecord</code>."
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "ficha": {
    "sections": {
      "anatomia": {
        "content": [
          "Responde a: <strong>¿cambió el HTML de este nodo?</strong>",
          "          Cuando alguien añade/quita hijos, cambia un atributo o el texto, emite",
          "          <code class=\"code\">iswc-mutate</code> con el detalle de qué pasó."
        ]
      },
      "atributos": {
        "table": [
          {
            "name": "<code>child-list</code>",
            "que hace": "Observa altas/bajas de hijos (y, con subtree, nietos)."
          },
          {
            "name": "<code>attr</code>",
            "que hace": "Lista de atributos a vigilar (espacio-separados). Activa el filtro."
          },
          {
            "name": "<code>character-data</code>",
            "que hace": "Observa cambios de texto."
          },
          {
            "name": "<code>disabled</code>",
            "que hace": "Apaga el observer."
          },
          {
            "name": "<code>iswc-mutate</code>",
            "que hace": "Evento. <code>detail.records</code> = array de <code>MutationRecord</code>."
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "exclude": [
      "apiJs",
      "ejemplos",
      "eventos",
      "parts",
      "props",
      "slots",
      "states"
    ]
  }
}
